{"id":"cb582ee79087af80","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-soundness.md","title":"KF对极小固定点模型的可靠性","display":"thm-KF-soundness — KF对极小固定点模型的可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-soundness","aliases":["91-thm-KF-soundness","91-thm-KF-relative-soundness","91-thm-KF-consistent"],"display":"thm-KF-soundness — KF对极小固定点模型的可靠性","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-soundness</span><span>91-thm-KF-relative-soundness</span><span>91-thm-KF-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-soundness — KF对极小固定点模型的可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-KF-soundness-—-KF-对极小固定点模型的可靠性\">thm-KF-soundness — KF 对极小固定点模型的可靠性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> (规范强 Kleene 跳跃的极小一致固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\min}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma_{\\min})\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\min}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma_{\\min})\\)</span> (经典外层 KF 结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (其公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\min}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\)</span> 中成立的标准系统)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\sigma\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\sigma\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>特别地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是普通一阶可靠性应用于一个规范模型：逐项验证 KF 公理，再验证经典\n推理规则保真。三值强 Kleene 评价用于定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span>，而 KF 的\n外层满足关系仍是经典的。</p>\n<p>极小固定点包含于每个一致固定点，所以已在其中取得的真信息也出现在\n所有一致固定点。原备注把方向写反了。若允许非一致/glut 模型，则必须\n另行限定；裸 KF 的全部模型不等同于一致固定点类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-KF-soundness-—-KF-对极小固定点模型的可靠性","text":"thm-KF-soundness — KF 对极小固定点模型的可靠性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_{\\min}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\Gamma_{\\min})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\mathrm{KF}\n\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\sigma\n\\to\n\\mathcal M_{\\min}\\models\\sigma\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"edf61bb893ee0ba7","anchor":"ref-3","